Start polkitd as its dedicated account, as the OpenRC service does.
Dropping root inside polkitd makes /proc/self/fdinfo root-owned on Linux,
preventing elogind session lookup for authorization checks.

--- a/data/org.freedesktop.PolicyKit1.service.in
+++ b/data/org.freedesktop.PolicyKit1.service.in
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 [D-BUS Service]
 Name=org.freedesktop.PolicyKit1
 Exec=@libprivdir@/polkitd --no-debug
-User=root
+User=polkitd
 SystemdService=polkit.service
